# ScamGuard .env.example

Copy to `.env` and fill in the values. The `.env` file is git-ignored.

## Supabase (scan history storage)

- `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` — your Supabase project URL.
- `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` — your Supabase anon/publishable key.

## Gemini (optional — powers the AI verdict dashboard)

- `GEMINI_API_KEY` — Google Gemini API key. When unset, the app falls back to its
  rule-based detector and shows no AI verdict.
- `GEMINI_MODEL` — Gemini model to call (default `gemini-3-flash-preview`, which is the
  current free-tier model).
- `GEMINI_TIMEOUT_MS` — max milliseconds to wait for a Gemini verdict (default `30000`).
  Increase to `60000` if a slow free-tier response times out.

## App

- `FRONTEND_URL` — comma-separated list of allowed CORS origins (used by `server.js`).
  Leave empty to allow all origins locally.

## Development

- `VITE_AI_ENABLED` — set to `false` to disable the AI verdict (rule engine still runs).
